      "seed": 319313339,
      "version": 527,
      "versionNonce": 537313653,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779423160290,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This file will serve as the governance file for a Spec Kit\nproject. \n\n- The project’s engineering contract.\n\nIt answers: \nHow should we build in this project?\nWhat quality rules must always be respected?\nWhat should Claude/AI never violate?\nWhat standards guide every feature?\n\nconstitution.md is the persistent rulebook that tells Spec Kit\nand Claude Code what engineering standards must guide the\nproject. It is created once, updated rarely, and used as the\nfoundation for all future feature specs and implementation\nwork.",
      "fontSize": 13.787886404802805,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "t024uGWpJYG3I82wk41cl",
      "originalText": "This file will serve as the governance file for a Spec Kit project. \n\n- The project’s engineering contract.\n\nIt answers: \nHow should we build in this project?\nWhat quality rules must always be respected?\nWhat should Claude/AI never violate?\nWhat standards guide every feature?\n\nconstitution.md is the persistent rulebook that tells Spec Kit and Claude Code what engineering standards must guide the project. It is created once, updated rarely, and used as the foundation for all future feature specs and implementation work.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
