    {
      "id": "AUaWXM4LjzJ8chS01-iGh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1132.9728376844153,
      "y": -2113.563543965516,
      "width": 407.01641845703125,
      "height": 318.08874288777514,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "0gUrKDNb9MBrj2eraWoIy"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aRG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 76706037,
      "version": 596,
      "versionNonce": 1320242619,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779423510565,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Defines user behavior, acceptance criteria, UX states,\nedge cases, and scope for one feature.\n\nIt answers:\nWhat problem are we solving?\nWho is the user?\nWhat should the user be able to do?\nWhat are the acceptance criteria?\nWhat are the edge cases?\nWhat is out of scope?\nWhat UX states must exist?\n\n- Usually what goes are the product requirements (User\nStory - Jira ticket format)\n\n- User Story - Requirements - UX States - Acceptance\nCriteria - Out of scope. ",
      "fontSize": 14.968882018248243,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "YxpXEfSjHVTdpHzEp4IHr",
      "originalText": "Defines user behavior, acceptance criteria, UX states, edge cases, and scope for one feature.\n\nIt answers:\nWhat problem are we solving?\nWho is the user?\nWhat should the user be able to do?\nWhat are the acceptance criteria?\nWhat are the edge cases?\nWhat is out of scope?\nWhat UX states must exist?\n\n- Usually what goes are the product requirements (User Story - Jira ticket format)\n\n- User Story - Requirements - UX States - Acceptance Criteria - Out of scope. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
