      "updated": 1779425401469,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If the work is important enough to need a spec, it is important enough to implement in controlled tasks.\nUsing spec.implement or asking Claude to “implement the whole spec” is tempting, but for a senior engineering\nworkflow it is usually too broad.",
