      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779425076098,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "At this point claude will:\n→ read context\n      → explore files\n      → propose plan\n      → implement\n      → validate\n      → self-review\n\nHuman will always be in the loop, so if proposed\nplan require changes, human will give feedback\nand point the agent to the right direction\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "HzwRUj050OP_kt0mTdIgW",
      "originalText": "At this point claude will:\n→ read context\n      → explore files\n      → propose plan\n      → implement\n      → validate\n      → self-review\n\nHuman will always be in the loop, so if proposed plan require changes, human will give feedback and point the agent to the right direction\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
